WEBVTT

00:14.940 --> 00:16.700
Dariel!

00:17.370 --> 00:18.650
What's wrong?

00:18.650 --> 00:22.620
While on my quest, I encountered 
the most amazing individual!

00:22.960 --> 00:24.720
An amazing individual?

00:28.090 --> 00:31.460
This is the previous Hero, Alantsil!

00:36.620 --> 00:38.800
<i>The Hero Alantsil?</i>

00:41.050 --> 00:44.340
Dariel! Where's my snack?

00:44.340 --> 00:47.020
You know, the one your missus made for me!

00:49.010 --> 00:50.020
What's this?

00:50.490 --> 00:54.900
Grandpa, your boobs are showing.

00:53.970 --> 00:54.900
<i>This is bad!</i>

00:54.900 --> 00:57.740
<i>Lady Zebiantes will never return home again!</i>

00:57.740 --> 00:59.990
I-I'm so sorry!

00:59.990 --> 01:00.880
Come here!

01:00.880 --> 01:02.700
What?

01:02.700 --> 01:04.270
Do you want to die?

01:04.270 --> 01:07.210
That's Alantsil, 
the strongest Hero in history.

01:07.480 --> 01:09.120
Alanchi?

01:09.120 --> 01:11.460
You saw his burns, didn't you?

01:12.030 --> 01:16.470
Lord Granbarza used his Flaming 
Gaol of Endless Searing Screams.

01:16.470 --> 01:18.080
That's how he got those!

01:18.800 --> 01:21.470
He survived getting hit with that?

01:21.470 --> 01:23.110
Do you understand now?

01:23.110 --> 01:26.000
He's a battle machine that sheds 
neither tears nor blood.

01:26.000 --> 01:27.600
Any thoughtless words could...

01:28.810 --> 01:32.160
M-Mister Alantsil?

01:33.360 --> 01:34.070
W-Watch...

01:34.070 --> 01:36.200
Come, shake my hand!

01:36.200 --> 01:36.920
...out?

01:41.880 --> 01:44.080
It's Mister Alantsil!

01:44.390 --> 01:46.000
Yay!

01:46.000 --> 01:47.830
It's the old Hero!

01:48.650 --> 01:50.330
Look, you're so high!

01:55.280 --> 01:57.100
More! Do more!

01:58.910 --> 02:00.340
Wha?!

02:00.650 --> 02:03.720
<i>I-It's like a merciless murderer theme park.</i>

02:10.100 --> 02:12.110
You must be tired.

02:12.820 --> 02:16.080
I'm sorry. I interrupted your conversation.

02:16.080 --> 02:17.490
Oh, not at all.

02:17.490 --> 02:20.140
She's an acquaintance of mine and...

02:21.930 --> 02:24.120
Come, shake my hand.

02:26.900 --> 02:29.370
I-Isn't that wonderful, Zebi?

02:29.830 --> 02:33.380
Mister Alantsil, please have 
a seat on the sofa over there.

02:33.610 --> 02:35.730
What a kind old man!

02:35.730 --> 02:38.520
Kind to humans, that is.

02:38.520 --> 02:41.310
Please, when you see a chance,
 get away from here!

02:41.310 --> 02:43.260
One thing to be careful of...

02:43.540 --> 02:45.920
He can sense magical energy.

02:45.920 --> 02:50.020
Please wait at least until you've 
left the village to use magic.

02:50.020 --> 02:51.650
Yes, yes.

02:51.650 --> 02:54.460
After I've finished eating the 
snack your missus made for me.

03:13.790 --> 03:18.090
<b>Chillin'</b>

03:13.790 --> 03:18.090
<b>in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

04:28.990 --> 04:32.000
<b>Episode 9</b>

04:28.990 --> 04:32.000
<b>Dariel Has a Reunion.</b>

04:36.700 --> 04:38.420
I apologize for not 
introducing myself sooner.

04:38.420 --> 04:40.390
I'm the mayor, Dariel.

04:41.370 --> 04:42.170
So...

04:42.800 --> 04:44.520
What is it that brings you here?

04:45.150 --> 04:50.250
I heard that my apprentice Laidy has been 
troubling you here for quite some time.

04:50.250 --> 04:51.770
I'm terribly sorry!

04:52.120 --> 04:54.810
My journey to vanquish the 
Demon King is taking too long...

04:54.810 --> 04:57.030
There's no need to apologize.

04:57.030 --> 04:58.830
I'm the one at fault here.

04:58.830 --> 04:59.520
What?

04:59.810 --> 05:03.540
I was too hasty in sending you off.

05:03.540 --> 05:05.910
Now that these wounds have healed,

05:05.910 --> 05:10.800
I thought that I'd drill into you all 
the things I'd forgotten to tell you.

05:10.800 --> 05:14.330
Then does that mean I'll be able to 
train under you again, Master Alantsil?

05:14.330 --> 05:15.290
It does.

05:15.540 --> 05:17.150
<i>This is perfect.</i>

05:17.150 --> 05:19.790
<i>Lady Zebiantes can use that time to escape.</i>

05:20.480 --> 05:23.090
Then allow me to show you 
to our training grounds.

05:25.610 --> 05:28.480
Mayor, just one thing before that.

05:28.980 --> 05:29.610
Yes?

05:30.920 --> 05:35.060
Since a little while ago, 
I've sensed a suspicious presence.

05:35.520 --> 05:36.060
What?

05:38.580 --> 05:40.620
Big Bro!

05:40.620 --> 05:41.840
Oh!

05:43.310 --> 05:46.070
That's our strongest adventurer.

05:51.920 --> 05:54.920
Don't look at me. Look at the previous Hero.

05:54.920 --> 05:56.170
You'll learn a lot.

05:56.170 --> 05:57.080
Yes, sir!

05:57.970 --> 06:00.320
I will instruct you through 
actual battle practice.

06:00.320 --> 06:01.070
Yes, sir.

06:02.270 --> 06:04.150
Attack whenever you're ready.

06:12.350 --> 06:14.060
He's dodging while signing autographs?

06:14.890 --> 06:18.310
Well, you see, I can't 
keep the children waiting.

06:25.280 --> 06:27.190
<i>What did he mean by "actual battle"?</i>

06:27.840 --> 06:29.820
<i>He's just toying with her!</i>

06:32.820 --> 06:35.700
<i>To think that Laidy is this 
helpless against him.</i>

06:36.770 --> 06:38.050
Thank you!

06:38.570 --> 06:41.210
It seems you haven't been 
shirking your training.

06:41.720 --> 06:44.710
Your sword skills are undeniably improved.

06:44.710 --> 06:46.660
Who have you been learning from?

06:46.660 --> 06:49.650
Dariel has been kind enough 
to give me lessons.

06:49.650 --> 06:51.220
The mayor?

06:51.450 --> 06:55.720
As far as I can tell, he's the
 strongest I've met besides you.

06:56.050 --> 06:59.230
<i>There's no need to provoke him like that!</i>

06:59.530 --> 07:00.680
I see.

07:01.180 --> 07:03.230
When a person becomes truly strong,

07:03.690 --> 07:06.050
it becomes difficult to sense their true power...

07:06.920 --> 07:09.240
because the person themselves 
will try to hide it.

07:11.660 --> 07:15.560
Mayor Dariel, I would like 
to ask you to spar with me.

07:17.200 --> 07:21.620
Will you show my apprentice the strength 
that makes her speak of you this way?

07:21.880 --> 07:25.340
No, I've retired as an adventurer, so...

07:25.340 --> 07:28.050
Yeah. The mayor's amazing, 
but even he couldn't...

07:28.050 --> 07:30.050
Not against the previous Hero.

07:30.050 --> 07:33.530
Hey! Don't underestimate my big bro!

07:33.530 --> 07:35.800
You all know how strong he is!

07:35.800 --> 07:38.570
But his opponent is just too tough. Right?

07:38.570 --> 07:39.560
Yeah.

07:41.180 --> 07:42.680
The s-strongest...

07:42.680 --> 07:44.270
is my big bro.

07:45.680 --> 07:47.940
<i>Do I have no other choice but to do this?</i>

07:57.630 --> 07:58.840
<i>This isn't good.</i>

07:58.840 --> 08:00.450
<i>Now that I'm actually facing him...</i>

08:09.680 --> 08:12.930
<i>The previous Hero is terrifying.</i>

08:14.210 --> 08:15.940
E-Excuse me?

08:18.530 --> 08:19.820
Before we do that...

08:21.680 --> 08:23.970
No one can fight on an empty stomach.

08:24.780 --> 08:26.440
Let's have our lunch first.

08:29.130 --> 08:30.440
Yes, that's true.

08:35.780 --> 08:37.450
What is this?

08:37.940 --> 08:40.070
I've been told it's called 
a shrimp tempura rice ball.

08:44.680 --> 08:48.950
A fatty savoriness bids "hello" from 
the rice, cooked slightly firmer than usual!

08:48.950 --> 08:54.220
And the shrimp gives its greetings with 
a pleasingly plump, tender mouthfeel!

08:56.420 --> 08:57.970
A-Are you all right?

08:57.970 --> 09:00.050
Just a little heartburn.

09:00.050 --> 09:03.000
I can't handle oily foods very well anymore.

09:03.000 --> 09:05.980
I'm so sorry. Please, don't 
force yourself to eat.

09:07.220 --> 09:10.480
No, this makes me happy. 
It's been a long time.

09:11.410 --> 09:13.740
Eating a packed lunch that 
someone else made for me...

09:18.200 --> 09:20.580
It was they who turned the 
previous Hero, Alantsil...

09:21.110 --> 09:22.660
into a merciless monster.

09:28.490 --> 09:29.660
Say...

09:29.660 --> 09:30.420
Yes?

09:30.700 --> 09:33.080
Shall we have something light 
and refreshing for dinner?

09:37.180 --> 09:40.680
Just as I thought. 
He doesn't seem scary at all.

09:41.920 --> 09:44.580
Well, now. Since I did 
promise and everything...

09:46.510 --> 09:48.930
I'll go ahead and walk home.

09:50.630 --> 09:51.190
Oh!

09:54.860 --> 09:57.150
Nice catch, if I do say so myself.

09:57.150 --> 09:59.820
I think I might just get a 
little bonus from the missus!

10:01.940 --> 10:03.740
Wh-What's wrong?

10:20.390 --> 10:21.890
Wh-What's going on?

10:25.520 --> 10:26.820
You, girl...

10:29.420 --> 10:31.400
So you're a demon?

10:39.840 --> 10:42.570
I did sense that you were 
someone out of the ordinary,

10:42.830 --> 10:45.830
but, Mayor, we shall have our match later.

10:46.590 --> 10:49.910
Right now, I must eliminate the demon.

10:55.980 --> 10:57.130
Even if it's a demon...

10:57.840 --> 11:00.630
the taking of a person's 
life within this village...

11:00.970 --> 11:02.430
is something I will not allow!

11:02.970 --> 11:05.970
<b>Chillin'
 in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

11:12.980 --> 11:15.180
<i>The former Hero, Alantsil.</i>

11:16.800 --> 11:19.190
<i>This isn't the first time I've faced him.</i>

11:20.240 --> 11:21.550
<i>But always before...</i>

11:23.290 --> 11:27.280
Stand back. I will protect all of you.

11:27.280 --> 11:30.250
<i>Lord Granbarza kept us safe.</i>

11:32.750 --> 11:35.760
Please, listen to me, Mister Alantsil!

11:37.880 --> 11:41.880
If you plan to interfere, 
then I'll have to ask you to leave.

11:52.620 --> 11:53.480
Sting!

12:11.930 --> 12:12.790
Guard!

12:15.130 --> 12:16.380
Big Bro!

12:16.380 --> 12:17.790
Dariel!

12:18.190 --> 12:19.550
Stay back!

12:23.820 --> 12:27.010
<i>To think he can destroy 
a stone wall with just a stick!</i>

12:30.600 --> 12:37.030
I never imagined that there was anyone 
blessed with all four attributes but me.

12:40.890 --> 12:44.950
When I was still the Hero, 
I sought out the strong.

12:44.950 --> 12:48.190
Why was I never fortunate 
enough to come across you?

12:48.190 --> 12:51.200
No, it still isn't too late.

12:51.520 --> 12:53.760
Become the Hero, Dariel.

12:54.270 --> 12:59.150
Together, we can tear the wicked 
demon race up by the roots.

12:59.150 --> 13:00.200
That won't be possible.

13:00.960 --> 13:02.010
Really?

13:02.460 --> 13:05.220
Is that so? In that case...

13:05.220 --> 13:07.510
I will use my Fearsome Emperor's Sky Rend.

13:08.540 --> 13:10.770
It will be infused with Sting Aura.

13:12.320 --> 13:14.230
It will not miss.

13:21.130 --> 13:23.810
Fearsome Emperor's Sky Rend!

13:30.490 --> 13:31.740
Guard!

13:32.270 --> 13:33.680
Big Bro!

13:40.790 --> 13:44.170
There are lives you fear might be taken.

13:47.090 --> 13:49.150
Thus, you do not wish to fight.

13:49.760 --> 13:51.900
That's simple enough and easy to understand.

13:52.860 --> 13:55.390
Master Alantsil, any more than this and...

13:55.390 --> 13:57.140
Please, I beg of you! Master Alantsil!

14:05.310 --> 14:07.820
You are incomprehensible.

14:08.360 --> 14:10.560
Why would you protect the demons?

14:12.560 --> 14:14.480
Race doesn't matter.

14:16.490 --> 14:20.440
I just don't want anyone 
to be hurt. That's all.

14:20.950 --> 14:23.130
That's impossible.

14:24.720 --> 14:29.130
The two races have killed each
 other since long, long ago.

14:29.830 --> 14:31.650
How will you protect them?

14:31.650 --> 14:34.970
Don't tell me you're aiming for world peace.

14:36.760 --> 14:39.840
If that's what's necessary... 
then that's what I'll aim for.

14:39.840 --> 14:42.150
What a noble spirit.

14:42.470 --> 14:44.280
It's not nobility.

14:45.700 --> 14:47.150
I'm doing it for myself.

14:47.860 --> 14:49.650
When someone gets hurt...

14:50.260 --> 14:51.820
I hurt.

14:53.270 --> 14:55.520
I just don't want to hurt.

14:56.740 --> 15:01.670
Mister Alantsil, I've heard that you 
experienced something incredibly painful.

15:02.840 --> 15:05.530
I have a wife and child, too.

15:06.340 --> 15:11.450
Simply imagining losing 
them is mortally painful.

15:12.300 --> 15:13.820
And, for me...

15:13.820 --> 15:17.310
Lady Zebiantes, trembling behind 
me right now, is also precious.

15:17.310 --> 15:19.760
If I lost Lady Zebiantes...

15:19.760 --> 15:21.090
it would be just as painful.

15:24.570 --> 15:27.900
I simply don't want to experience 
anything that awful.

15:27.900 --> 15:29.220
I'm just doing it for myself.

15:30.600 --> 15:34.570
Why are you so taken by demons?

15:37.080 --> 15:38.080
Because I...

15:39.030 --> 15:41.440
was raised by demons.

15:45.630 --> 15:48.990
It's been a while... hasn't it?

15:49.880 --> 15:52.720
I'm just so forgetful, you know?

15:53.600 --> 15:55.640
Have you recovered from your wounds,

15:55.980 --> 15:57.980
Granbarza?

15:57.980 --> 15:58.690
Sire.

15:59.270 --> 16:02.720
I am glad to find Your 
Majesty in good spirits.

16:02.720 --> 16:06.650
It has been too long since last I attended you.
 I am utterly ashamed at being so remiss.

16:06.650 --> 16:08.210
May I say...

16:08.900 --> 16:12.400
It seems that your form 
has changed once again.

16:12.400 --> 16:14.240
And you look even more valiant than before.

16:14.240 --> 16:19.960
Oh, if little ol' me looks like 
a fearsome monster to you,

16:19.960 --> 16:22.410
that's proof that you've gotten stronger.

16:23.550 --> 16:26.420
I don't know how I appear to you,

16:26.420 --> 16:31.610
but my form is a mirror that 
reflects yourself back at you.

16:31.610 --> 16:34.680
And you're at an age where 
you're still growing, you see.

16:35.890 --> 16:39.730
So you have a request 
of me today, don't you?

16:39.730 --> 16:40.540
Yes, sire.

16:42.010 --> 16:46.190
It's my foolish son, Bashbarza.
 Please fire him.

16:46.190 --> 16:49.510
I wish to receive a royal command for 
an immediate change of personnel.

16:51.590 --> 16:53.190
And why would that be?

16:53.570 --> 16:55.700
In addition to a series of failures,

16:56.480 --> 16:59.700
he has hidden himself away 
for more than a year's time,

16:59.700 --> 17:03.760
and he has abandoned his 
duties as one of the Four Generals.

17:05.720 --> 17:07.430
He never leaves his chambers,

17:07.430 --> 17:10.140
and they say that he does not answer 
the entreaties of this underlings.

17:12.670 --> 17:18.920
Currently, your Demon King's Army 
persists on the efforts of Doroye alone,

17:18.920 --> 17:21.310
but she cannot be made to carry 
the full weight of it forever.

17:21.970 --> 17:26.030
It would severely limit your 
son's future prospects. Is that all right?

17:26.030 --> 17:27.350
It matters not.

17:27.350 --> 17:29.980
I beg of you. This is for the sake 
of your Demon King's Army as well.

17:29.980 --> 17:31.980
For the Demon King's Army?

17:32.450 --> 17:33.820
No, it's not.

17:34.740 --> 17:36.960
It's for your own sake, isn't it?

17:37.550 --> 17:40.290
You're just angry.

17:40.290 --> 17:43.270
Angry because Dariel was fired.

17:44.000 --> 17:46.290
More than the son who shares your own blood,

17:46.290 --> 17:52.000
it's the underling you took in and 
raised who is precious to you.

17:56.010 --> 17:59.180
T-To the east of here... in a forest...

17:59.180 --> 18:03.570
I've left behind something... which can 
be a secret weapon against the Hero.

18:04.170 --> 18:09.750
Used properly... it can surely kill the hero...

18:10.360 --> 18:13.110
Wh-When that day comes...

18:13.560 --> 18:17.070
tell them that the one who 
brought about this victory...

18:17.070 --> 18:22.870
was me, the General of Water, Bezetan!

18:23.730 --> 18:25.210
Illusion magic?

18:35.960 --> 18:36.950
A baby?

18:41.740 --> 18:45.040
Um, is there anyone here who knows your name?

18:45.590 --> 18:46.890
No, I guess not.

18:50.280 --> 18:53.610
I'm sorry that it's a guy like 
me who's come to fetch you.

18:54.960 --> 18:56.900
But it's going to be all right.

18:56.900 --> 18:58.890
I will protect you!

18:59.900 --> 19:02.960
You see, I've been chosen 
as one of the Four Generals!

19:02.960 --> 19:05.810
We're the strongest among the demons!

19:11.600 --> 19:12.890
You're like an angel!

19:13.420 --> 19:15.960
I know! Dariel.

19:16.450 --> 19:19.030
That's your name. What do you think?

19:23.720 --> 19:27.930
No, they are both precious sons to me.

19:29.930 --> 19:31.760
Lux Village.

19:32.940 --> 19:36.900
A human village to the southwest 
of the demon kingdom.

19:36.900 --> 19:39.940
Dariel is there.

19:39.940 --> 19:41.980
I thank you for your kindness, Your Majesty.

19:43.300 --> 19:46.190
I don't know if you'll be able 
to bring him back or not, though.

19:46.700 --> 19:50.710
It seems he's settled in rather well there.

19:50.710 --> 19:57.370
I've heard he, like the previous Hero, has 
all four types of Aura and does great deeds.

19:59.110 --> 20:03.930
I've left behind something... which can 
be a secret weapon against the Hero.

20:05.090 --> 20:08.430
The demons... raised you?

20:08.430 --> 20:09.170
Yes.

20:09.990 --> 20:15.610
Thirty-three years ago, Bezetan, 
then the General of Water, found me.

20:15.610 --> 20:18.700
He entrusted me to Lord Granbarza,
 who then raised me.

20:20.240 --> 20:23.690
<i>I put an end to the one who had raided us,
 Bezetan of the Four Generals,</i>

20:24.530 --> 20:28.140
<i>but my son... Not even his 
corpse returned to me.</i>

20:31.500 --> 20:35.550
Dariel, how old are you now?

20:35.550 --> 20:37.670
I'm thirty-three. Why?

20:47.080 --> 20:50.040
You're my son.

20:51.290 --> 20:52.180
What?

20:53.690 --> 20:56.070
W-Wait. Just a moment, please.

20:56.070 --> 20:57.940
Why would you think that?

20:58.870 --> 21:00.940
Thirty-three years ago...

21:01.670 --> 21:04.590
my wife was killed by Bezetan 
of the Four Generals.

21:05.220 --> 21:09.040
I had thought that my son 
was killed then, too.

21:09.040 --> 21:09.980
But...

21:11.300 --> 21:14.040
After hearing what you've just told me...

21:14.570 --> 21:17.710
The four Aura attributes are 
passed from parent to child.

21:18.320 --> 21:23.210
In short, everything proves 
to me that you are my son.

21:24.260 --> 21:26.780
<i>The previous Hero, Alantsil...</i>

21:27.300 --> 21:29.720
<i>is my real father?</i>

21:37.730 --> 21:39.440
Barrier of Blazing Heat...

21:50.280 --> 21:53.020
L-Lord Granbarza!

22:04.060 --> 22:06.070
You've grown so much stronger,

22:07.180 --> 22:08.300
Dariel.

23:41.550 --> 23:45.730
Next time on <i>Chillin' in My 30s after 
Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</i>,

23:46.110 --> 23:48.440
"Dariel, Showered in Sparks."

23:48.440 --> 23:50.990
<b>Episode 10</b>

23:48.440 --> 23:50.990
<b>Dariel, Showered in Sparks.</b>
